        "id": "textbook-common-errors",
        "moduleId": "error-landscape",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么这些错误值得集中讨论",
        "markdown": "在使用 `malloc()` 和 `free()` 时，会反复出现一组常见错误。教材指出，这些例子几乎都能通过编译并运行，但对构建正确的 C 程序来说，通过编译只是必要条件，远不是充分条件。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000165"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
